Z||000000||DR650SE||11-01-2001||04:44 PM||||Whats up with that?  When the head light goes down the motor won't quit spinning.  Right now its outside with the fuseout.  When I drove it home i turned the lights on and off a few min. later.  Now the motor runs constantly and so I drive with them up and turn them off and take the fuse out when i park.  Please help.  Thanks.<P>               Kindest Regards,<BR>                  Dan Tillman<P>------------------<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD||||reg||5
Z||000001||bocefas||11-01-2001||04:50 PM||||Sounds like it's time for a motor rebuild...My 86 GT suffered the same fate, so I took the opportunity to upgrade to the later style headlights.  I highly recommend this!!!  They operate faster and are much quieter.  It only takes an hour or so to do everything, and it's well worth it, plus the later style motors are more readily available and easier to rebuild.||||reg||1
